"Swift","RA1W LA1W","The fastest mech in the League. Finds the enemy for the artillery and is gone before they react.","Harrier","A fast medium striker that flanks with burst lasers and seeker rockets.","Gale","A tiny scout hover that is mostly engine. Nothing on the field is faster on open ground or water.","Cyclone","A hit-and-run hover with a rocket salvo big enough to hurt a heavy mech.","Kite","A light attack VTOL that strikes from unexpected angles.","Peregrine","A tiltrotor missile gunship that keeps its distance.",
"Brushfire","Rocket pods on both arms and a seeker rack. Empties everything into one target at short range.","Firestorm","A walking battery: a howitzer for spotted targets, missiles for anything that gets close.","Pyre","Missiles at every range. Opens with volleys and closes with a heavy rocket salvo.","Salvo","A rocket tank that saturates whatever is in front of it.","Longreach","Ashfall\'s long-range siege gun, with its own sensor mast to find targets.","Sparkfly","A cheap missile truck. Fires guided volleys from behind cover.",
"Watchman","An electronic scout that jams enemy missiles while it spots for friendly artillery.","Arbiter","A command mech that sharpens the whole lance and scrambles enemy targeting.","Oracle","A sniper that sees through woods and night, and hits what it sees.","Relay","A command car bristling with antennas: boosts nearby allies and jams enemy missiles.","Skein","An electronic-warfare hover. Its ion lance leaves enemies firing blind.","Sentinel","An air-defense and missile platform with a full sensor suite.",
"Thorn","A medium brawler with a battle axe and a repair kit to keep it in the fight.","Briar","Closes under smoke and staggers its target with a thunder hammer.","Bramble","Thornwall\'s siege-breaker: a great axe, a heavy rocket pod and a hide like a fortress wall.","Pike Squad","Two anti-tank teams that wait in the woods for armor to come close.","Sapper Team","Demolition troops who crawl up to vehicles under smoke and plant satchel charges.","Hedgehog","T3T F2F F1F","A squat assault tank that lays smoke and fights at point-blank range.",
"Badger","A tough six-wheeled gun car. Cheap to buy and cheap to fix.","Mongrel","Rockets welded onto a mining truck, with a ram plate on the front.","Ox Hauler","An eight-wheeled howitzer hauler. Slow off-road, quick on the roads.","Ranger","A fast frontier scout car with a long-range light cannon.","Homesteader","An old, dependable workhorse mech. Nothing fancy, everything fixable.","Prospector Rifles","Tough frontier riflemen who hold a town for as long as it takes.","Wraith","A knife-fighter wrapped in jamming. Appears out of smoke behind your lines.",
"Shade","A fast medium raider with an arc sword and a jammer.","Nightfall","A heavy raider that closes under smoke and burns its target with plasma.","Phantom","A jamming raider hover that strikes the flanks and vanishes into smoke.","Murk","A night-black raider VTOL with a jammer.","Ghost Cell","Infiltrators with sensors and demolition charges. They see you first.","Vanguard","The Accord\'s common light mech: dependable, computer-aimed, built on three worlds.","Paladin","A shared Accord line mech, the backbone of its allied lances.",
"Templar","An Accord heavy mech balanced between lasers and missiles.","Sovereign","The Accord\'s flagship command mech: twin heavy lasers and a command uplink.","Skylark","An Accord recon VTOL with sensors and a jammer.","Tern","A sturdy Accord hovertank for river and coastal fighting.","Accord Rangers","Accord recon infantry who carry an anti-tank launcher just in case.","Aurora","An Accord missile car with a computer-aimed laser.","Anvil","The Pact\'s main battle tank, built in all three member states.",
"Bison","A Pact armored car: light cannon, rockets, and room to take a beating.","Hammerfall","A Pact self-propelled howitzer that can defend itself up close.","Forge","The Pact\'s common medium mech: cannon, rockets, reactive armor.","Crucible","A Pact heavy fire-support mech with guided missiles and a cannon.","Colossus","The Pact\'s assault mech: a siege cannon, heavy missiles, and four legs to carry it all.","Pact Heavy Weapons","A Pact weapons platoon with a mortar and an anti-tank team, dug in properly.",
"Gunhawk","A Pact gunship with a nose cannon and a chin gun.","Zenith","A Helion prototype built around the Sunlance focusing laser.","Dreadnought","The Hegemony\'s super-heavy tank destroyer, carrying the Hegemon Rail.","Zephyr","A Kestrel racing prototype with an afterburner. Nothing on legs is faster.","Cataclysm","An Ashfall siege prototype: the Hellfire Rack up close, heavy volleys at range.","Panopticon","A Meridian command prototype whose Omni-Link makes a whole lance shoot straighter.","Warlord","Thornwall\'s champion: the Siegebreaker ram and armor like a castle gate.",
